Fides OS v0.1


Commands:
  help    - show this help
  clear    - clear screen
  echo    - print text
  mem     - show memory
  info    - system info
  time    - show RTC time
  date    - show RTC date
  reboot  - restart system
  poweroff - turn off
  malloc  - test heap alloc
  disk    - read disk sector 0
  run     - load & run user program
  elf     - load ELF from sector 2
  ps      - show processes
  ticks  - show timer ticks
  halt    - stop CPU
  ls      - list files
  cat     - read file


